quantbot.lock
# The daemon's single-writer mutex. Its siblings above were ignored and this one was missed,
# so it was committed in 644752c. Runtime state does not belong in version control: git writes
# to it during a checkout while the daemon holds an exclusive OS lock on it, and every clone
# ships a stray file. It is not a liveness spoof -- `daemon_holds_lock` acquires the lock rather
# than checking the path -- but it has no business being tracked.
*.daemon.lock
crypto.db
crypto.lock
crypto-probe.db
crypto-probe.lock
research/stocks.db
